# 📚 TOEIC Vocabulary - Day15

| Word    | Meaning   | Example                               |
| ------- | --------- | ------------------------------------- |
| delay   | 지연시키다, 지연 | The flight was delayed.               |
| confirm | 확인하다      | Please confirm your reservation.      |
| request | 요청하다      | We received a request from a client.  |
| replace | 교체하다      | We need to replace the old equipment. |
| refund  | 환불        | The customer requested a refund.      |

